<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A fork standing where the stopwatch dot used to be, on the free end of the
  arc at twelve.

  The whole drawing is scaled to 0.88 about the centre. At full size the
  tines reach 39dp from the middle, and a launcher's circular mask keeps
  only the central 36dp — the tips would have been cut off on exactly the
  phones this is drawn for. Scaled, the furthest point is 34dp.
-->
